<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">&lt;B&gt;Communication&lt;/B&gt; Library can be used to perform data read and write operations through I2C, SPI and Serial Comm Port. This library is applicable for NI Hardware’s like USB-8452 and USB-232.
These Measurement Libraries are created based on existing LabVIEW Serial and ni845x example libraries from “C:\Program Files (x86)\National Instruments\LabVIEW &lt;version&gt;\examples\” location.</Property>
